  "slug": "open62541-aes-ctr-length-boundary",
  "title": "A stream length is not a block length",
  "description": "open62541 rounded TPM-backed AES-CTR payloads to a block boundary and stored the result in an eight-bit length. The result could truncate processing or read and write beyond the caller's buffer.",
